  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that concentration of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;and degree of dissociation is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p>The equilibrium reaction of weak electrolyte&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8652;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8595;</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8595;</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8595;</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>)</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;The equilibrium constant is the ratio of the concentrations of reactants and products raised to the stoichiometric coefficients.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>C&#945;</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>C&#945;</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mrow><mn>108</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mrow><mn>108</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p></blockquote>"
